在適用 CC BY 4.0 的部分，請依條款署名、連結授權、註記修改，且不得暗示原整理者或館藏機構背書。事實、連結、歷史文字及不具新著作權的內容，不因置於本包或標示 CC BY 而自動產生新的排他權利。

## 第三方影像、工具與未公開材料

底本影像與完整上游 OCR 只提供來源連結，不隨本包再散布；原館藏機構與平台的權利及條款另論。本包也不含館方標誌、TEI schema、字型、私人網站程式、專用處理與驗收程式、提示詞、技能、完整助手紀錄或模型。這些材料不在本檔的授權範圍。

## English statement

The historical English translation published by James Legge in 1882 is public-domain material. This dataset imposes no new Creative Commons conditions on that historical text. Copyrightable original modern metadata, documentation and arrangement are licensed under CC BY 4.0, attributed to poplolioi11 / 一卦 yigua.art. Attribution of the historical witness and translator is requested for traceability, not imposed as a new restriction on public-domain text. Linked scans retain their separate institutional and platform context and are not redistributed. No endorsement or universal jurisdictional legal certification is asserted.
